<title>THAILAND: Thai July trade deficit revised to 35.3 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai July trade deficit revised to 35.3 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand on Thursday revised Thailand's July trade deficit to 35.3 billion baht from 30 billion estimated earlier for the month and against a revised 36.9 billion baht deficit in June.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE    July 96    June 96	 July 95</p>
<p>	  Exports	     110.8	109.1	   114.4</p>
<p>	  Imports	     146.1	146.0	   151.9</p>
<p>	  Trade balance     -35.3	-36.9	   -37.5</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok Newsroom (662)-252-9950</p>
</text>
